Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(spike): durable AgentSession facade

Wrap a real AgentSession (in-memory SessionManager, engine never runs) in a
Proxy that reroutes prompt/steer/followUp/abort/compact/model mutation to the
durable root Conversation, and feed watchEvents batches through the parent
_handleAgentEvent so persistence, extensions, and TUI events run the
production path. Wayfinder ticket 006, route B.
